flowchart TD
    A[Units display health] --> B[Rotate camera or change health]
    B --> C[Project current frame and remove offscreen items]
    C --> D[Update retained HUD scene]
    D --> E{All lane items move identically?}
    E -->|Yes| F[Reuse with current translation]
    E -->|No| G[Draw current item positions]
    F --> H[Compare current values and pixels]
    G --> H
    H -->|Mismatch| I[Fail and save comparison images]
    H -->|Match| J[Hold camera and verify no jump back]
    J --> K[Runtime recording: near-view acceptance pending]
